{"steam_appid":3926930,"steam_name":"Poopy's Playland","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3926930/1422947654/9dabfe92d7506d4f9862304eadc2dedd89b56f83/1762810607/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764096944","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229309/3167ec9e3cbb88ba65c5fac07b6396d4d0f77721/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764096944","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/611fc885375d8a7fd0ec688eb04f941cebb52f80/ss_611fc885375d8a7fd0ec688eb04f941cebb52f80.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789747211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/edd1f550dccea655edeba567f18615a86f672c02/ss_edd1f550dccea655edeba567f18615a86f672c02.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789747211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/7888202b1ce86652e9e687697a5219da19be7ef8/ss_7888202b1ce86652e9e687697a5219da19be7ef8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789747211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/73d3ca2862c0a736b09a58c282fa207ee9901036/ss_73d3ca2862c0a736b09a58c282fa207ee9901036.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789747211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/47ab3779246bd40e9efd34389e052dbc2d56f4db/ss_47ab3779246bd40e9efd34389e052dbc2d56f4db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789747211"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Poopy's Playland, a game where you play as a mother of a lost child trying to figure out the mystery of the disappearance. Break into the one-year abandoned playland where kids once came to play and have fun. Figure out what really happened!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminate</strong> the dark atmosphere with your trusty flashlight!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/4a8fe80de5fcf5e1d305407c12c9d34b.poster.avif?t=1789747211\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/4a8fe80de5fcf5e1d305407c12c9d34b.webm?t=1789747211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam</strong> around the abandoned building  full of play-structures and games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/47db97ae2f6853326e3a9818e15ce23a.poster.avif?t=1789747211\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/47db97ae2f6853326e3a9818e15ce23a.webm?t=1789747211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate </strong>different tools and items throughout the game to progress and unlock new areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/06911a73236efd08bc9b412b366b4042.poster.avif?t=1789747211\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/06911a73236efd08bc9b412b366b4042.webm?t=1789747211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve</strong> replayable puzzles that dynamically changes through each playthrough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/f8574267e41c2b4232be32838d5e4a9c.poster.avif?t=1789747211\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/f8574267e41c2b4232be32838d5e4a9c.webm?t=1789747211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak</strong> around the playground in the dark to avoid getting caught by the robots!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/c7dbe2a2cf868db12b96be0293fe546d.poster.avif?t=1789747211\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926930/extras/c7dbe2a2cf868db12b96be0293fe546d.webm?t=1789747211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figure</strong> out what actually happened one year ago and rest your unresolved mind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable unique puzzles that changes every playthrough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A controllable companion friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first person view!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful ray-traced reflections!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoothly transitioned first person cutscenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A take on the mascot horror genre never seen before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you to</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>playtesters</strong> (who is the reason the game is less buggy and more fun!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>voice actors</strong> (who made the characters come to life!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>music composers</strong> (for adding the overall feels of the game!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My <strong>friends</strong> and <strong>family</strong> (for the unconditional support, I love you guys!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More specific credits can be found in the game.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["EmilJoes Games"],"publishers":["EmilJoes Games"],"release_date":"Sep 18, 2026"}